        {
          "text": "Kwathi uFeliksi esezwile lezizinto, ekwazi ngokugcweleyo kakhulu ngaleyo Ndlela, wababuyisela emuva, wathi: Nxa uLisiya induna yenkulungwane esehlile, mina ngizakwazi ngokugcwele indaba yenu.",
