              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waselaya induna yekhulu ukuthi agcinwe uPawuli, njalo abe lenkululeko, njalo kungavinjelwa muntu wakubo ukumkhonza kumbe ukuza kuye.",
          "type": "text",
