              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwathi emva kwezinsuku ezithile wafika uFeliksi noDrusila umkakhe owayengumJudakazi, wabiza uPawulu, wamuzwa ngokukholwa kuKristu.",
          "type": "text",
