              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esakhuluma ngokulunga, nokuzithiba, nokwahlulela okuzayo, uFelike washaywa luvalo, waphendula wathi: “Okwamanje hamba; nxa nginesikhathi esihle, ngizakubiza.",
